  "limitations": [
    "The corner façade and 14 de Mayo gateway follow exact published public-domain Qualla originals. The corner view was published in 2008 and lacks an independently established exposure date.",
    "The older restoration is shown in early color photographs. The later recovery of the former stable property, alley paving, adjacent buildings and museum interior are outside the scope.",
